    "rationale": "ICU/CCU/PACU monitoring is life-critical; latency budgets demand on-prem deployment near the bedside. RPM (home telemetry) is public-cloud-eligible because the wearables already live on the public internet. Air-gapped PICU and federal hospitals require sovereign on-prem cells."
